Build-host paths
----------------

`libksud.so` embeds a build-user cargo-registry path (`…/.cargo/registry/…`)
from the machine that built it. The binary is otherwise unmodified from the
repository artifact. Rebuild with `RUSTFLAGS="--remap-path-prefix=$HOME=/build"`
to strip such paths in future refreshes.

